# Free only

Cái gì dùng free được thì phải dùng free. Người làm dự án không có tiền để bắt đầu.

This rule wins over convenience, defaults, and tool suggestions.

## Do

- Render locally with HyperFrames, Node.js, and FFmpeg already on the machine.
- Use free local tools: ShareX for capture, Whisper or `npx hyperframes transcribe --language vi` for a first caption pass, and fonts under OFL or another free license.
- Pass `--local-only` when a HyperFrames media command has a network provider.
- Stop and ask before any step that spends money.

## Do not

- Do not call a paid API, HeyGen credit, cloud render, Lambda, Cloud Run, avatar, voice clone, or hosted TTS when a free path exists.
- Do not run `heygen auth`, `hyperframes cloud`, `lambda render`, `cloudrun render`, or `feedback` that phones home.
- Do not install a paid subscription or add a secret key to make a prototype work.
- Do not treat "better quality" as a reason to spend money. Quality comes from the free local path plus human review.

## Example

```text
Need a voiceover.
Free path: the person records their own voice, or captions only.
Paid path: HeyGen voice. Forbidden until the person explicitly approves spending money.
```
